[?2004l[?2004h> 2. 2026-08-15 00:54:55: Attacker successfully authenticates as root via SSH password brute force `/disk/var/log/secure:178`.
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. 2026-08-15 00:55 - 01:29: Attacker conducts post-exploitation activity:
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Dropped and executed Monero cryptominer binary at `/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg` (`/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg`, `/sas/alerts.json`).
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Installed cron persistence in `/var/spool/cron/root` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/root:5`, `/sas/alerts.json`).
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Installed shell-init persistence in `/root/.bashrc` (`/disk/root/.bashrc:2`).
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Installed systemd service persistence at `/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service`, `/sas/alerts.json`).
