[?2004l[?2004h>    - Cleared authentication logs causing log gap between 00:54:55 and 01:29:12 (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`, `/disk/var/log/secure:178`).
[?2004l[?2004h>    - Executed hydra brute-force tool against internal targets from devops user account context (`/disk/home/devops/.bash_history:6`).
[?2004l[?2004h> 4. 2026-08-15 03:20: Incident detected and intake logged by SOC (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`).
